  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 932270,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "# IGDB - The $100,000 Pyramid for Your C64!\n\nStep right up and test your wordplay skills in this faithful Commodore 64 adaptation of the classic TV game show, *The $100,000 Pyramid*!  IGDB challenges you and a friend (or solo, in a less traditional mode) to climb the pyramid of words and reach the top.\n\nEach round, choose a category – from \"things that are red\" to countless others – and race against the clock to guess words based on your partner’s cryptic clues.  The catch? You *can't* say the word itself!  Strategic clue-giving and sharp deduction are key to success.  \n\nExperience the thrill of the show as you rack up points and ascend the pyramid.  The single-player mode offers a different challenge, tasking you with crafting single-word clues to guide yourself.  Fast-paced, engaging, and perfect for two players, IGDB brings the excitement of *The $100,000 Pyramid* to your Commodore 64!  How high can you climb?"
    },
